  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hirondelle Radio Miraya FM - Hirondelle MirayaFM</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hirondelle Radio Miraya FM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Hirondelle &quot;Fortsatt fr&#xe4;mjande av press frihet i Sudan&quot;; kapacitets   byggande och nationsomfattande s&#xe4;ndning av radioprogrammet Miraya FM. Budget ca 72 MSEK 1 januari, 2009 - 31 december, 2011.                Samarbetspartners inkluderar Schweiz, Tyskland och UNMIS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hirondelle &quot;Further Unleashing the Power of Press Freedom in Sudan&quot;;  capacity building and nation wide broadcasting of the radio program   Miraya FM. The overall development intervention cost is approximately 72 million Swedish kronor (MSEK), and is planned to be implemented    during January 1, 2009 to December 31, 2011. Development partners     include Switzerland, Germany and UNMIS.</narrative>
  </description>
